flowchart LR
    Start([Customer Opens Site]) --> Browse[Browse Menu]
    Browse --> Select[Select Item & Qty]
    Select --> Add[Add to Cart]
    Add --> Checkout{Checkout Valid?}
    
    Checkout -->|No| Fix[Fix Form Errors]
    Fix --> Checkout
    
    Checkout -->|Yes| Submit[Submit Order via API]
    Submit --> Save[(Save to MongoDB)]
    
    Save --> Notify[Owner Dashboard Polls Data]
    Notify --> Process[Owner Processes Order]
    Process --> Deliver[Mark Status 'Delivered']
    Deliver --> End([Order Complete])

    style Start fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style End fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style Save fill:#ff9,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
